{"id":"pokemon","kind":"thematic","title":"Pokémon","description":"A researched selection of Pokémon postage stamps, sheetlets and souvenir-sheet stamps across twelve issuing territories.","notes":["Scott sheet numbers are stored on sets, not repeated as individual stamp numbers. Individual Scott suffixes have not been inferred.","Guyana date conflict: StampWorld dates g6639/g6645 to 30 October 2000; IGPC dates Scott 3571–3572 to 13 February 2001. Source dates are retained.","Liberia entries are listed by StampWorld and IGPC; no Scott number is asserted.","Japan 2021 and the France four-stamp collector use explicitly local identifiers sourced from postal authorities, because no StampWorld number was verified.","This is not an exhaustive worldwide checklist. Dominica overprint variants are not separately resolved. Non-postal stickers and unverified issues are excluded.","Chunghwa Post schedules a Pokémon souvenir sheet for 20 November 2026. It is not included as an issued stamp as of 19 September 2026."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.igpc.com/thumbs.cfm?keywordsearch1=pok%C3%A9mon","purpose":"Scott sheet/souvenir-sheet numbers and issue listings"},{"url":"https://www.post.japanpost.jp/kitte_hagaki/stamp/tokusyu/2005/h170623_t.html","purpose":"Japan 2005 issue"},{"url":"https://www.post.japanpost.jp/kitte/collection/archive/2021/0707_01/0235.pdf","purpose":"Japan 2021 issues and numbered designs"},{"url":"https://www.lecarredencre.fr/timbre/pokemon/","purpose":"France 2024 Pikachu and collector"},{"url":"https://www.lecarredencre.fr/timbre/pokemon-2/","purpose":"France 2024 booklet"},{"url":"https://subservices.post.gov.tw/post/internet/U_english2/index.jsp?ID=35170204","purpose":"Upcoming Taiwan issue; excluded until issued"}],"countries":["gambia","grenada","grenada-grenadines","guyana","antigua-barbuda","dominica","liberia","st-vincent","micronesia","sierra-leone","japan","france"],"summary":{"stampCount":143,"setCount":33},"periods":{"2000-2001":{"sets":[{"id":"[